# A48 Tier 1 (TeraDesk via #Z, sd-tera.img, 640x480; before = HEAD bd9cd19's
# shell.rs + shell_loop.rs, after = the tree). Sequence: park bottom-right;
# hover the Options title (260,8) -> drop-down; click "Video options..."
# (MVOPTS, x 224..439 y 163..178) at (300,170); the VOPTIONS dialog opens
# with its root at (164,113) (form_center (161,110,318,278) incl. the 3 px
# xd_border); click the ST-Low radio (obj 4, (196..299,177..192)) at
# (247,185) -- ST-Low/ST-Medium are the only enabled buttons: TeraDesk's
# `static long vdo` stays 0 without a _VDO cookie -> vdohi = ST_VIDEO ->
# vd_enable_rez(VSTMED) (video.c:60,494-507); click OK (obj 20,
# (316..379,353..368)) at (347,361) -> ARESCH alert; click its " OK "
# (frame (243..317,262..291)) at (280,276) -> voptions() returns 1 -> chrez
# -> quit -> get_set_video(2): shel_write(SHW_RESCHNG, ST_LOWRES+2 = 2,
# 0) (video.c:363-365,378-379) -> wait_to_quit 2000 ms + wait(500) ->
# appl_exit (main.c:2025,2050,2062,2124) -> the kernel desktop comes back
# (AUTORUN_APP -> DESKTOP_APP, shell_loop). Marks G/H fire once the
# desktop is up ("[desk] desktop up" arms DESK_UP).
200 parkbr
1000 arm
1100 mark A_IDLE
1400 move 260 8
2200 move 300 170
2500 down
2503 up
3100 mark C_VIDEO_DIALOG
3400 move 247 185
3700 down
3703 up
4100 mark D_STLOW_PICKED
4400 move 347 361
4700 down
4703 up
5300 mark E_ALERT
5600 move 280 276
5900 down
5903 up
6000 mark F_CONFIRMED
6100 parkbr
6900 mark G_AFTER_4S
7600 mark H_DESKTOP_BACK
